	Register("Side-question context still exceeds the model budget after compaction; narrow the question or adjust the model context configuration", "Side-question context still exceeds the model budget after compaction; narrow the question or adjust the model context configuration", "압축 후에도 보조 질문 문맥이 모델 예산을 초과합니다. 질문 범위를 줄이거나 모델 문맥 설정을 조정하세요")
	Register("[Historical side question, based on context at ", "[Historical side question, based on context at ", "[과거 보조 질문, 문맥 기준 시간 ")
